found that I had kept adding more rules over the years:\n</p>","content_type":"application/xhtml","length":null,"src":null},"links":[{"href":"https://www.redblobgames.com/blog/2026-03-25-optimizing-page-size/","target":null,"rel":"alternate","media_type":null,"href_lang":null,"title":null,"length":null}],"summary":null,"categories":[],"contributors":[],"published":"2026-03-25T19:05:00Z","source":null,"rights":null,"media":[],"language":null,"base":null}]}